// Aftershock_dx9 (aftershock_ps20b / aftershock_vs20): the frame copy
// (_rt_FullFrameFB, a solid color) refracted through two scrolling layers of
// $normalmap, blurred and divided by the tone-mapping scale, tinted by
// $colortint where the view meets the normal ($silhouettethickness, the ground
// fade $groundmin / $groundmax) and lit by the silhouette highlight, blended by
// that mask. The camera is at the origin and the quad at z 0.5 faces it; its
// normals and TANGENT (user data) vary so the mask does. $time fixes the
// scroll.
